Third-Party Components
================================================================================

This software uses the following third-party libraries. Full license texts
are available in the Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) generated during the
release process.

Rust Dependencies:
- libloading (ISC) - Dynamic library loading
- log (MIT/Apache-2.0) - Logging facade
- num-derive (MIT/Apache-2.0) - Numeric trait derive macros
- num-traits (MIT/Apache-2.0) - Numeric trait definitions
- flatbuffers (Apache-2.0) - FlatBuffers serialization (optional)

For a complete list of dependencies and their licenses, see the SBOM
artifact published with each release.

Vendored Source:

This distribution redistributes third-party source code in the following
locations. These are not Rust crate dependencies and therefore do not appear
in the SBOM.

- crates/tflite-sys/litert/
    LiteRT C API headers
    Copyright 2024-2025 Google LLC
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Source: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT (tag v2.1.6)
    License text: crates/tflite-sys/litert/LICENSE
    Local modifications: crates/tflite-sys/litert/patches/

    These headers are used solely as bindgen input to generate FFI type
    definitions; they are not compiled or linked into the resulting binaries.

